    <string name="about_credits">Fuyao Locale is a substantial rewrite built from concepts and functionality of Language Selector by VegaBobo. The system language list is inspired by MultiLocale by Nightdavisao. The Liquid Glass tab bar and the Miuix theme are built with AndroidLiquidGlass by Kyant0 and miuix.</string>
    <string name="about_license">Fuyao Locale is licensed under GNU AGPL v3 only (AGPL-3.0-only). Portions derived from Language Selector retain their Apache License 2.0 notices. MultiLocale is distributed under the MIT License. AndroidLiquidGlass and miuix are distributed under the Apache License 2.0.</string>
